<title>UK: SuedwestLB unit sets 1.0 billion Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB unit sets 1.0 billion Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTLB CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.75     MATURITY    06.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    06.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
</text>
